{"product_id":"m-series-elastic-headband-accessory-standard","title":"M-Series Comfort Headband","description":"\u003cp\u003eDesigned for all-day wear in situations not requiring alternative head protection, the Vuzix Comfort Headband is adjustable for a variety of head sizes and positions. Complete with rail mounts for easy attachment of the Vuzix M-Series glasses and any compatible head-mounted battery on either side, this cushioned headband keeps your smart glasses perfectly balanced and stable.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Standard","offer_id":43647313674406,"sku":"472T0A015","price":49.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/Pro-CaptureOne2175-grey.png?v=1724436104","url":"https:\/\/www.vuzix.com\/products\/m-series-elastic-headband-accessory-standard","provider":"Vuzix Corporation","version":"1.0","type":"link"}